# French outreach

Maria reviews and sends mail herself. Create Gmail drafts only. Never send.

Always greet with `Bonjour` + the person's first name. Never a bare `Bonjour,`. Take the name from their signature or From line. If they signed only as a studio, find the person we wrote to (or the named contact) and use that name. Ask rather than drop the name.

Match tu/vous to how they wrote. Body stays short.

Signatures: montage → `editing` / Video Editor. Retouch → `retouch` / Photo retoucher.
